# Raw reference dataset (100+MB of CSVs) — mounted read-only into the api
# container (see infra/docker-compose.yml's `../../data:/data:ro`), not
# meant to live in git history. See docs/DATA_INGESTION.md for what's done
# with it and how to point the platform at your own copy.
/data/
